.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH g-workflow-create 1  "g-workflow-create " 
.SH NAME
g\-workflow\-create \- Create a new workflow interactively
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBg\-workflow\-create\fR [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-local\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new workflow interactively
.PP
Opens a full\-screen wizard to define a custom workflow with branch types, merge strategies, hooks, and validation rules.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<PRESET>\fR
Start from a preset
.TP
\fB\-\-local\fR
Save to repo\-local config (.g/workflow.toml)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-interactive\fR
Skip interactive wizard, save defaults immediately
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
Workflow name
